    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok thanks. what about the risk transfer? like when does the responsibility for damage actually switch from the seller to us (the buyer)? original post mentioned something about the goods being \"placed on board\" so im a bit confused about when the risk actually moves.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
